{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become a movie mogul in Super Movie Tycoon! From script to screen, build your dream team and create blockbusters to conquer Hollywood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/Y1.png?t=1744851036\" />Through your creative designs, build a unique cinematic world! From scriptwriting to set construction, from character development to special effects, every detail is crafted by your own hands. Here, you are the director, screenwriter and producer - use your boundless imagination to create your own blockbusters!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/\u7535\u5f71\u9879\u76ee_GIF_01.gif?t=1744851036\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/Y2.png?t=1744851036\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new land plots and carefully plan each professional department to create a highly efficient film production pipeline. Maximize the value of every piece of land and witness the rise of your dream film studio from scratch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/\u7535\u5f71\u9879\u76ee_GIF_02.gif?t=1744851036\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/y3.png?t=1744851036\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit top-tier film talents to build your dream team! From genius screenwriters to ace directors, from veteran crew members to special effects experts, strategically allocate human resources for every position. With professional HR management, inject endless creativity into your film kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/\u7535\u5f71\u9879\u76ee_GIF_03.gif?t=1744851036\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/Y4.png?t=1744851036\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a Hollywood-level production empire. From budget control to scheduling, use data-driven refined management to optimize every operation. Make your film company stand out in fierce industry competition and create your own entertainment legend!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/\u7535\u5f71\u9879\u76ee_GIF_04.gif?t=1744851036\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/Y5.png?t=1744851036\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let your film empire dominate the global cinema scene, sweeping all honors at international top-tier film festivals. Create timeless masterpieces and make every production the biggest winner during awards season, achieving legendary status in film history!\u00a0<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/\u7535\u5f71\u9879\u76ee_GIF_05.gif?t=1744851036\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639380?t=1744851036","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639380?t=1744851036","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/ece17ea973f343f4cffac30ae663a932cad7df2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744851036","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor